    {
      "text": "3 Wolves killed",
      "description": "The legendary bounty 'The Wolf Man' has plenty of wolves to kill. From the start of the mission, pick the right hand yellow target, and as you come over the hill, use a scoped rifle to kill wolves at a distance. You can quit out if you want after killing three. [#2]",
      "all_descriptions": [
        "Wolves often attack between Fort Riggs and Riggs Station. Try Tall Trees, east of Aurora Basin.\nAbove MacFarlane's Ranch on the road to Harriet's, or by the railway south-east of the ranch.\nCumberland Forest can be a good location. Generally wolves tend to be out at night. [#1]",
        "The legendary bounty 'The Wolf Man' has plenty of wolves to kill. From the start of the mission, pick the right hand yellow target, and as you come over the hill, use a scoped rifle to kill wolves at a distance. You can quit out if you want after killing three. [#2]",
        "The Blood Money Crime, 'The Railroad Contract Part 1' has wolves to shoot and skin at the railroad camp, easy kills. [#3]",
        "Go to Wapiti, then ride down towards Cotarra Springs. Wolves often attack as you come out of the trees where the road forks in two below the 'R' of 'AMBARINO' on the map. [#4]"
      ],
